docs {
  # catalog

  Categories, products, prices and images (`docs/domain/event-storming.md`).

  Before the first run: `pnpm infra:up`, copy `apps/catalog/.env.example` to `apps/catalog/.env`
  (an existing `.env` needs the new `IDENTITY_JWKS_URL`), `pnpm --filter @ecommerce/catalog db:migrate`,
  then `pnpm dev:catalog`.
}
